<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#g">Bu&#x0364;r</hi>-</fw>         <lb/>
<pb n="145" facs="#f0159"/>
<p><hi rendition="#g">Bu&#x0364;rgermei&#x017F;ter</hi>. Ich will's nicht hindern,<lb/>
